{"id":"bb3ae520d70609fb","group":"92","path":"92/92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability.md","title":"Consistency and Letterless Stability","display":"cor-modal-consistency-and-stability — Consistency and Letterless Stability","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability","aliases":["92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability"],"display":"cor-modal-consistency-and-stability — Consistency and Letterless Stability","source":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness]]","[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-modal-consistency-and-stability — Consistency and Letterless Stability"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9d01ba91fb099b79\" href=\"?note=9d01ba91fb099b79\" title=\"92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness\">92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd433626d0825ffc\" href=\"?note=bd433626d0825ffc\" title=\"92-df-normal-stable-system\">92-df-normal-stable-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}\">\\(U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}\\)</span>；关联五元组见上游。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConSys},\\mathrm{StableSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConSys},\\mathrm{StableSys}\\)</span> 的来源为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd433626d0825ffc\" href=\"?note=bd433626d0825ffc\" title=\"92-df-normal-stable-system\">92-df-normal-stable-system</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}and\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{ConSys}(\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(U))\\land\n\\mathrm{StableSys}(\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(U))\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}and\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{ConSys}(\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(U))\\land\n\\mathrm{StableSys}(\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(U))\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>底不可能是正确的 letterless 定理，所以全系统不能证明底。若 U 证明 Box X 且 X letterless，自指正确性给其真值，Box 真值定义给 U 证明 X，故限制域 StableSys。</p>\n<p>原书 p.134 的说明提到 Box Box X→Box X 的可证性，下一页 Exercise 16 却要求证明不能证明全部这样的实例。此处用正确的“Box X 可证 ⇒ Box X 真 ⇒ X 可证”，不假定内部稳定性模式已可证，也不从 letterless 域外推含变量公式的逆 Necessitation。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"9d01ba91fb099b79","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-normal-stable-system","status":"resolved","id":"bd433626d0825ffc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-normal-stable-system","status":"resolved","id":"bd433626d0825ffc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConSys},\\mathrm{StableSys}$ 的来源为 [[92-df-normal-stable-system]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConSys},\\mathrm{StableSys}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}modal\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}and\\text{-}stability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall U\\in\\{\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\}\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{ConSys}(\\mathcal M_{\\Box}(U))\\land\n\\mathrm{StableSys}(\\mathcal M^0_{\\Box}(U))\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1531,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-letterless-truth]] → [[92-df-modal-self-referential-correctness]] → [[92-thm-modal-self-referential-correctness]] → [[92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability]]。"},{"id":"1f1a5dcc2c5a5996","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-358","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-cor-modal-consistency-and-stability]]"}],"outgoing":["9d01ba91fb099b79","bd433626d0825ffc"]}